Now I am getting ready for the office.
I go into my room.
I open the cupboard.
I am taking out my clothes.
I put on my office clothes.
My office bag is on the table.
I put my laptop in the bag.
I am putting the charger in the bag too.
Now I am going into the kitchen.
My lunchbox is ready.
I put my lunchbox in the bag.
The water bottle is also in the bag.
Now I am checking my wallet.
The money for the bus is in the wallet.
I look for my phone and keys.
My phone is on the bed.
I put the phone in my pocket.
The house keys are on the table.
I am checking everything one more time.
Now I am completely ready to go outside.
